{"t":"ZTS","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Zoetis Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","employees":14500,"hq":"Parsippany, NJ, United States","website":"https://www.zoetis.com","summary_en":"Zoetis Inc. engages in the discovery, development, manufacture, and commercialization of medicines, vaccines, diagnostic products and services, biodevices, genetic tests, and precision animal health solutions for the animal health industry in the United States and internationally. The company commercializes products primarily across companion animals comprising dogs, cats, and horses; and species, including livestock, such as cattle, swine, poultry, fish, and sheep. It also offers parasiticides, vaccines, dermatology, anti-infectives, pain and sedation, other pharmaceutical, and animal health diagnostics. In addition, the company provides animal health diagnostics, including point-of-care diagnostic products, instruments and reagents, rapid immunoassay tests, reference laboratory kits and services, and blood glucose monitors; and other non-pharmaceutical products, which include nutritionals, as well as products and services in biodevices, genetic tests, and precision animal health. It markets its products to veterinarians, livestock producers, and pet owners. The company has collaborated with Blacksmith Medicines, Inc. to discover and develop novel antibiotics for animal health. Zoetis Inc. was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Parsippany, New Jersey.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Zoetis Inc.는 미국 및 전 세계의 동물 건강 산업을 위한 의약품, 백신, 진단 제품 및 서비스, 생체 장치, 유전자 테스트 및 정밀 동물 건강 솔루션의 발견, 개발, 제조 및 상업화에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 주로 개, 고양이, 말 등 반려동물을 대상으로 제품을 상품화합니다. 소, 돼지, 가금류, 어류 및 양과 같은 가축을 포함한 종. 또한 구충제, 백신, 피부과, 항감염제, 진통제, 기타 의약품 및 동물 건강 진단을 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 현장 진단 제품, 기기 및 시약, 신속한 면역 측정 테스트, 참조 실험실 키트 및 서비스, 혈당 모니터를 포함한 동물 건강 진단을 제공합니다. 영양제뿐만 아니라 생체 장치, 유전자 검사, 정밀 동물 건강 분야의 제품과 서비스를 포함하는 기타 비의약품 제품도 포함됩니다. 수의사, 축산업자, 애완동물 소유자에게 제품을 판매합니다. 이 회사는 Blacksmith Medicines, Inc.와 협력하여 동물 건강을 위한 새로운 항생제를 발견하고 개발했습니다. Zoetis Inc.는 2012년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지 주 파시패니에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":82.65,"mcap":33582030848.0,"pe":14.056123,"fpe":12.9583645,"peg":3.9162,"ps":3.5371847,"pb":10.196151,"ev_ebitda":10.276,"div":2.56,"beta":0.678,"hi52":132.49,"lo52":68.77},"fin":{"rev":9493999616.0,"rev_g":-0.013,"eps_g":-0.118,"gross":0.71645,"op":0.37908,"net":0.26406,"roe":0.57626,"fcf":2053124992.0,"cash":1532999936.0,"debt":9256999936.0,"de":280.26,"eps":5.88,"feps":6.37812},"own":{"short":0.0467,"inst":1.04093,"insider":0.002},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":89.69231,"median":85.0,"high":115.0,"low":73.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.5,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":2,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":4,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":5,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":82.0,"priorPriceTarget":85.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":85.0,"priorPriceTarget":80.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":83.0,"priorPriceTarget":103.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":74.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-25","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":94.0,"priorPriceTarget":104.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-20","Firm":"Stifel","ToGrade":"Hold",